"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-24T16:08:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T23:15:45Z","closed_at":"2026-04-01T23:14:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.7 dev 1 onward\n\nUnderlying bug reproducible in all versions of Godot with `Image.save_exr`.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev2 - macOS Tahoe (26.3.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I use `get_window().get_texture().get_image().save_exr(\"screenshot.exr\")` with a project that uses [HDR output](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.html), the resulting EXR screenshot sometimes does not match what I see in my game window.\n\nThere are two issues here:\n1. The result of negative lights (meant to represent non-physical negative radiance for lighting simulations) are saved as negative colours (which represent out-of-gamut colours in the EXR file format rather than representing negative radiance).\n2. Values above `Window.get_output_max_linear_value()` are saved to the EXR file, causing a different appearance than rendered through Godot.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a project with Mobile or Forward+\n2. Enable HDR output in the project using the [steps found in the tutorial](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.html)\n3. Create a scene that has colour component values that are below `0.0` or higher than the Window's output max linear value\n4. Save an EXR screenshot using: `get_window().get_texture().get_image().save_exr(\"screenshot.exr\")`\n5. View the EXR and the game window and notice that they appear different\n\n**Note:** This is best done on a Macbook because macOS has good native support of EXR and HDR output, but the problem can be seen on other operating systems with the correct image viewer.\n\n<img width=\"1430\" height=\"1759\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ef42175-607b-48cb-a9b7-c0babfd7bb78\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[save-hdr-exr-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26220135/save-hdr-exr-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117795/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117795/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}